<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine bolsa suspends trading of BAESA.</title>
<headline>Argentine bolsa suspends trading of BAESA.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Buenos Aires Stock Exchange said it suspended trading of PepsiCo's bottler BAESA after the company reported Friday that negative retained earnings exceeded its net worth.</p>
<p>BAESA reported earlier first half retained earnings of negative $48.5 million while its net worth was negative, at $18.7 million, under accounting principles generally accepted in Argentina (PCGA). ((--Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0652))</p>
